<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Vattenfall buys 8.1 pct Hafslund.</title>
<headline>Swedish Vattenfall buys 8.1 pct Hafslund.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish state-owned power company Vattenfall said on Tuesday it had bought 8.1 percent of A-shares in Norwegian power company Hafslund ASA, lifting its stake of votes in the company to 20 percent.</p>
</text>
